 girls at Yuihime Girls' Academy, though Airi does not want to get along with him or any of the other boys. He was sickly and asthmatic in his childhood, but he is in good health now. His parents are busy with their work and are seldom at home."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5290"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a8/a88b5b2a9fd99f48d51e59833c521f0324a012a507dd5aca037be08bd98c8771.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a7/a7df04c8a69f294ac20ca3eae3a7658c17aab9350842e04207c14f406104b51d.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"egs:brand:403","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:403","canonicalEntityId":"egs:brand:403","name":"ぱれっと","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:33109:403","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p10","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p10","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p10","name":"ぱれっと","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:119866:v37651","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p15756","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p15756","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p15756","name":"SVN","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:126800:v37651","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p19678","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p19678","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p19678","name":"GPT RE-BOOT!","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:127428:v37651","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p7360","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p7360","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p7360","name":"绿茶汉化组","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:129775:v37651","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p9483","sourceCo